<title>JAPAN: Comson says fails to honour promissory notes.</title>
<headline>Comson says fails to honour promissory notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Machinery maker Comson Corp said on Tuesday it had failed to honour promissory notes for the first time.</p>
<p>Details were not immediately available from the company.</p>
<p>But it said it would hold a news conference at 6.30 p.m. (0930 GMT).</p>
<p>A Japanese company which fails to honour promissory notes for a second time is considered insolvent.</p>
</text>
